    "Scene.Privacy.Description.%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "be" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Нягледзячы на ​​тое, што праграма Mastodon не збірае даных, сервер, на якім вы рэгіструецеся, можа мець іншую палітыку.\n\nКалі вы адмовіцеся ад палітыкі **%@**, вы можаце вярнуцца і выбраць іншы сервер."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "ckb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Přestože aplikace Mastodon neshromažďuje žádná data, server, přes který se přihlásíte, může mít jiné zásady.\n\nPokud nesouhlasíte se zásadami pro %@, můžete se vrátit a vybrat si jiný server."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Obwohl die Mastodon-App keine Daten sammelt, kann es sein, dass der Server, über den Sie sich anmelden, andere Richtlinien hat.\n\nWenn Sie mit den Richtlinien für **%@** nicht einverstanden sind, können Sie zurückgehen und einen anderen Server auswählen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Αν και η εφαρμογή Mastodon δεν συλλέγει δεδομένα, ο διακομιστής που εγγράφεσαι μπορεί να έχει διαφορετική πολιτική.\n\nΕάν διαφωνείς με την πολιτική του **%@**, μπορείς να επιστρέψεις και να επιλέξεις διαφορετικό διακομιστή."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Aunque la aplicación Mastodon no recopila ningún dato, el servidor al que se registra puede tener una política diferente.\n\nSi no está de a cuerdo con la política de **%@**, puede volver atrás y elegir un servidor diferente."
          }
        },
        "eu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mastodon aplikazioak daturik biltzen ez duen arren, erregistratzen zaren zerbitzariak beste politika bat izan dezake.\n\nEz bazaude **%@** zerbitzariaren politikarekin ados, atzera egin eta beste zerbitzari bat aukeratu dezakezu."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bien que l'application Mastodon ne collecte aucune donnée, le serveur sur lequel vous vous inscrivez peut avoir une politique différente.\n\nSi vous n'êtes pas d'accord avec la politique de %@, vous pouvez revenir en arrière et choisir un serveur différent."
          }
        },
        "gd" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ged nach cruinnich aplacaid Mastodon fhèin dàta sam bith, dh’fhaoidte gu bheil poileasaidh eadar-dhealaichte aig an fhrithealaiche leis a chlàraicheas tu.\n\nMur aontaich thu ris a’ phoileasaidh aig **%@**, rach air ais is tagh frithealaiche eile."
          }
        },
        "gl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Aínda que a aplicación de Mastodon non recolle ningún dato, o servidor no que te rexistres pode ter unha política diferente.\n\nSe non estás de acordo coas condicións de **%@**, podes volver atrás e elixir outro servidor."
          }
        },
        "hy" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "hy-AM" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy. Take a minute to review and agree to the Mastodon app privacy policy and your server’s privacy policy."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sebbene l'app Mastodon non raccolga alcun dato, il server tramite il quale ti registri potrebbe avere una politica diversa.\n\nSe non sei d'accordo con la politica di **%@**, puoi tornare indietro e scegliere un server diverso."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mastodon アプリはいかなるデータも収集しません。一方で、登録するサーバーはそれぞれが異なるポリシーを掲げていることがあります。\n\nもし %@ のポリシーに同意できない場合は、戻って別のサーバーを選択できます。"
          }
        },
        "kab" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "ku" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Hoewel de Mastodon-app geen gegevens verzamelt, kan de server waar je je aanmeldt een ander beleid hebben.\n\nAls je niet akkoord gaat met het beleid voor **%@**, kun je teruggaan en een andere server kiezen."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Čeprav program Mastodon ne zbira nobenih podatkov, ima lahko strežnik, prek katerega se prijavite, drugačno pravila glede zasebnosti.\n\nČe se s pravili za **%@** ne strinjate, se lahko vrnete in izberete drug strežnik."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "แม้ว่าแอป Mastodon ไม่เก็บรวบรวมข้อมูลใด ๆ เซิร์ฟเวอร์ที่คุณลงทะเบียนผ่านอาจมีนโยบายที่แตกต่างกัน\n\nหากคุณไม่เห็นด้วยกับนโยบายสำหรับ **%@** คุณสามารถย้อนกลับและเลือกเซิร์ฟเวอร์อื่น"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Although the Mastodon app does not collect any data, the server you sign up through may have a different policy.\n\nIf you disagree with the policy for **%@**, you can go back and pick a different server."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mặc dù ứng dụng Mastodon không thu thập bất kỳ dữ liệu nào, máy chủ mà bạn đăng ký có thể có chính sách khác.\n\nNếu không đồng ý với chính sách của **%@**, bạn có thể quay lại và chọn một máy chủ khác."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "尽管Mastodon客户端本身不采集任何数据，您注册的实例可能会有不同的隐私政策。\n\n如果您不同意**%@**的这些政策，请返回并选择其他实例。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "即使 Mastodon app 本身不會蒐集任何資料，您所註冊之伺服器可能有不一樣的隱私權政策。\n\n若您不同意 **%@** 之隱私權政策，您可以重新挑選另一個不同的伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
